# ==============================================================================
# Docker 构建上下文排除清单
#
# 构建上下文为项目根目录，以下内容无需发送给 Docker daemon。
# 合理排除可显著减小上下文体积并提升构建速度。
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------ 通用 ------------------------------
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github
.env
.env/
docker/.env
docker/application-docker.yml
lefthook.yml
.idea
.vscode
.DS_Store
*.log
*.md
!docker/README.md

# ------------------------------ 构建产物 ------------------------------
**/target
**/dist
**/dist.zip
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
target
dist
.turbo

# ------------------------------ 前端 ------------------------------
**/node_modules
node_modules
langchat-ui/node_modules
langchat-ui/apps/*/node_modules
langchat-ui/internal/*/node_modules
langchat-ui/packages/*/node_modules
langchat-ui/packages/@core/*/node_modules
langchat-ui/packages/effects/*/node_modules
langchat-ui/.changeset
langchat-ui/docs
langchat-ui/playground
langchat-ui/.playwright
langchat-ui/coverage

# ------------------------------ 运行时数据 ------------------------------
logs
.run
workspace
*.pid
release
.release.tmp.*

# ------------------------------ 其他 ------------------------------
docs/backend
docs/frontend
skills
